<view class="page yc-page">
  <page-heading eyebrow="经营管理" title="营业凭证" description="按授权范围查看附件，不跨门店或账号保留私密文件。" /><view class="card">仅可查看有权限门店的营业凭证。历史凭证无法读取时，请联系管理员核对。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card">正在读取凭证信息…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card error">{{error}}</view><button class="full" disabled="{{loading || busy}}" bindtap="load">刷新凭证</button><view wx:if="{{empty && !loading && !error}}" class="card empty-state">此记录没有营业凭证</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="index" class="card"><view class="heading">{{item.label}}</view><image wx:if="{{item.path}}" src="{{item.path}}" mode="widthFix" class="voucher-image"/><button class="full" wx:else data-index="{{item.index}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="view">查看图片</button></view></view>
